cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Belgian Chamber of Representatives Open Data: questions and speeches"
abstract: >-
  Dataset of all oral (plenary and committee) parliamentary questions
  posed in the Belgian Chamber of Representatives within session 56 (2024-2029).
  The data is compiled from official documents of the Belgian Chamber of Representatives (dekamer.be).
  The data contains question IDs, topics (NL + FR), questioners, questionees, respondents,
  discussion (speech transcript) in Parquet format. Content is in Dutch and French.
  Independent project, not affiliated with the Chamber.
authors:
